{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eko and the Bewitched Lands</strong> is  a randomly generated action RPG with Rogue-like elements. Explore and find the castle where the Dark Queen has imprisoned your friend and princess of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/7ec2309bdcf4fd3c41f1f2c7a4193b7d.poster.avif?t=1768424501\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/7ec2309bdcf4fd3c41f1f2c7a4193b7d.webm?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/7ec2309bdcf4fd3c41f1f2c7a4193b7d.mp4?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/e6e9285e1934bfa52beacfbade6b2cb8.avif?t=1768424501\" width=614 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/335f105ad5dabc5ad120862f118f238b.poster.avif?t=1768424501\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/335f105ad5dabc5ad120862f118f238b.webm?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/335f105ad5dabc5ad120862f118f238b.mp4?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is dinamic and fast paced. Dodge at the perfect time to be able to avoid enemy attacks or traps. Play very aggresive stopping enemies from hitting you or be a bit more strategic using your grenades or the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/3164deeaea38657b84bf948e7159ea89.avif?t=1768424501\" width=614 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/b5ea97ef531f9d1f2939177e7b7c8e16.poster.avif?t=1768424501\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/b5ea97ef531f9d1f2939177e7b7c8e16.webm?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/b5ea97ef531f9d1f2939177e7b7c8e16.mp4?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old relics are hidden in the world, find them and decipher their secrets. Some will give you amazing rewards while others will try to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/b834f3e67d8d6993333f26e1625a605f.avif?t=1768424501\" width=614 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/67460d94c19e621dcfe014fe95b521eb.poster.avif?t=1768424501\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/67460d94c19e621dcfe014fe95b521eb.webm?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/67460d94c19e621dcfe014fe95b521eb.mp4?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your abilities and enhance your playstyle! Each run offers unique and powerful upgrades, letting you adapt, experiment, and evolve your strategies. Will you harness fire, water, or something entirely different?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Full Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Elements (fire,water,thunder,shadow)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Bosses and 10 Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Random Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Special Card Ultimates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent Progression (Meta)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporal Progression (Run Progression)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save System (play as much as you like ;) )</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2786440?t=1768424501","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2786440?t=1768424501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/fb209bf31e5408d158d39107d8bb0d89bf7d501d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768424501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/fb209bf31e5408d158d39107d8bb0d89bf7d501d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768424501","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2932640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eko and the Bewitched Lands</strong> is  a randomly generated action RPG with Rogue-like elements. Explore and find the castle where the Dark Queen has imprisoned your friend and princess of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/7ec2309bdcf4fd3c41f1f2c7a4193b7d.poster.avif?t=1768424501\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/7ec2309bdcf4fd3c41f1f2c7a4193b7d.webm?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/7ec2309bdcf4fd3c41f1f2c7a4193b7d.mp4?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/e6e9285e1934bfa52beacfbade6b2cb8.avif?t=1768424501\" width=614 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/335f105ad5dabc5ad120862f118f238b.poster.avif?t=1768424501\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/335f105ad5dabc5ad120862f118f238b.webm?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/335f105ad5dabc5ad120862f118f238b.mp4?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is dinamic and fast paced. Dodge at the perfect time to be able to avoid enemy attacks or traps. Play very aggresive stopping enemies from hitting you or be a bit more strategic using your grenades or the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/3164deeaea38657b84bf948e7159ea89.avif?t=1768424501\" width=614 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/b5ea97ef531f9d1f2939177e7b7c8e16.poster.avif?t=1768424501\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/b5ea97ef531f9d1f2939177e7b7c8e16.webm?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/b5ea97ef531f9d1f2939177e7b7c8e16.mp4?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old relics are hidden in the world, find them and decipher their secrets. Some will give you amazing rewards while others will try to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/b834f3e67d8d6993333f26e1625a605f.avif?t=1768424501\" width=614 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/67460d94c19e621dcfe014fe95b521eb.poster.avif?t=1768424501\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/67460d94c19e621dcfe014fe95b521eb.webm?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/extras/67460d94c19e621dcfe014fe95b521eb.mp4?t=1768424501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your abilities and enhance your playstyle! Each run offers unique and powerful upgrades, letting you adapt, experiment, and evolve your strategies. Will you harness fire, water, or something entirely different?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Full Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Elements (fire,water,thunder,shadow)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Bosses and 10 Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Random Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Special Card Ultimates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent Progression (Meta)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporal Progression (Run Progression)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save System (play as much as you like ;) )</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Twin Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786440/header.jpg?t=1768424501","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2786440/671987686/4c489bcb49ae9fab558b1f48497004b51e766556/1750900458/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746984484","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2786440/671987686/4c489bcb49ae9fab558b1f48497004b51e766556/1750900458/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746984484","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2786440/671987686/4c489bcb49ae9fab558b1f48497004b51e766556/1750900458/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746984484","id":257012400,"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257012400/661be44d9046c69b69006b2e5d187e409a8644e8/movie_600x337.jp